# The partner commits CI builds molpy against -- the ONE place they would be
# pinned (scripts/partners.py; the workflows and the git hooks read it).
#
# molpy has none: molcrafts-molrs resolves from PyPI within the minor-line
# range in pyproject.toml, on every runner and every machine. So there is no
# path dependency CI could resolve either, and `scripts/partners.py check`
# (pre-push and ci.yml lint) fails on any [tool.uv.sources] path entry --
# release.yml refuses to tag with one.
#
# KEY=VALUE lines only. SELF is this repository's directory in a layout.
SELF=molpy
